<title>USA: Tatham Offshore names Eric Lynn Hill CFO.</title>
<headline>Tatham Offshore names Eric Lynn Hill CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tatham Offshore Inc said Thursday it had named Eric Lynn Hill as the company's chief financial officer.  </p>
<p>Tatham said Hill will replace Diana Walters, who resigned from the company to pursue a career in investment banking.</p>
<p>Hill was senior vice president-finance for Global Natural Resources Inc in Houston, it said.</p>
<p>Tatham explores, develops and produces oil and natural gas reserves in the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
</text>
